<title>GERMANY: Bunds spiral to weak close before long weekend.</title>
<headline>Bunds spiral to weak close before long weekend.</headline>
<text>
<p>1555 GMT - Bunds end sharply lower after slight weakness in Treasuries sparks panic selling in German markets as investors square positions head of long weekend and Tuesday's FOMC.</p>
<p>* 6.00% Jan 2007 Bund 101.62, bid yld 5.778 pct (102.22)</p>
<p>* June Bund future 101.84 (102.35), day's range 101.75-102.65</p>
</text>
